{"availability":"available","full":"Jiangyan-Zhao/BKP-website","name":"BKP-website","description":"Interactive website for BKP: Beta Kernel Process modeling in R, with installation guidance, paper results, and live BKP/TwinBKP examples.","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":2,"forks":0,"created":"2026-07-15T02:55:21Z","updated":"2026-10-04T12:12:28Z","license":null,"branch":"main","homepage":"https://jiangyan-zhao.github.io/BKP-website/","topics":["beta-kernel-process","binary-classification","dirichlet-kernel-process","github-pages","github-pages-website","interactive-visualizations","kernel-methods","multiclass-classification","probability-estimation","r-package","spatial-statistics"],"demo":"https://jiangyan-zhao.github.io/BKP-website/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T07:04:05.704Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T07:04:05.704Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T07:04:05.704Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T07:04:05.704Z","stars":2,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["This repository contains the companion website for BKP: Beta Kernel Process Modeling, an R package for nonparametric modeling of spatially varying binary, binomial, categorical, and multinomial probabilities.","The website provides an accessible introduction to the Beta Kernel Process (BKP), its Dirichlet extension (DKP), and the scalable TwinBKP and TwinDKP approximations. It combines methodological explanations, installation guidance, interactive visualizations, reproducible examples, and links to the associated software and paper.","Paper status: BKP: An R Package for Beta Kernel Process Modeling, by Jiangyan Zhao, Kunhai Qing, and Jin Xu, has been accepted in Journal of Statistical Software. The arXiv preprint remains available. Both the unified BKP/DKP framework and the scalable TwinBKP/TwinDKP extensions are contributions described in this paper."],"features":["DKP uses Dirichlet–multinomial updating for categorical and multinomial responses.","TwinBKP and TwinDKP use a global–local approximation based on twinning and nearest-neighbor selection for scalable modeling with large datasets."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Jiangyan-Zhao/BKP-website/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"03ac414b9d92c1b391ffdc73d55688ea3ddfb19aaeaa60a416b1296642e066d1","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T07:04:05.796Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T07:04:05.796Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"This repository contains the companion website for BKP: Beta Kernel Process Modeling, an R package for nonparametric modeling of spatially varying binary, binomial, categorical, and multinomial probabilities.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Jiangyan-Zhao/BKP-website/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"03ac414b9d92c1b391ffdc73d55688ea3ddfb19aaeaa60a416b1296642e066d1","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Jiangyan-Zhao/BKP-website/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T07:04:05.797Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-04T12:12:28Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Jiangyan-Zhao/BKP-website/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T07:04:05.797Z","hash":"03ac414b9d92c1b391ffdc73d55688ea3ddfb19aaeaa60a416b1296642e066d1","originalBytes":9305,"storedBytes":9305,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["bkp","website","beta","package","kernel","boldsymbol","process","modeling","paper","repository","software","posterior","cran","examples","github","local","statistical","version","bash","build","development","install","license","methodological","source","twinbkp","approximation","dkp","fit","interactive","jiangyan","npm","pak","probability","production","reproducibility","run","scalable","accepted","alpha","arxiv","citation","code","dirichlet","documentation","figures","framework","global","instructions","jin","journal","kunhai","matrix","multinomial","nrow","qing","repository.","scripts","see","through","twindkp","url","using","wo